WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
That's settled then, eh

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,600
Then I'll go back first

3
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,520
Is that Hexiang really that expensive?

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,520
I have to go back and ask them how they did it.

5
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:11,920
If it can be generated in batches

6
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:22,180
Then get rich and go back to General, eh?

7
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:26,160
I'm going to Li Dayou's house to see my mother

8
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,560
General Xiao has come to our house

9
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:28,760
General Xiao

10
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:31,920
Come in and take a seat, auntie

11
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:34,120
I want to ask if the Hexiang you made for me last time is still available?

12
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,120
Hexiang

13
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:38,120
That's the last box I have. Can I still make it?

14
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:39,320
It can be done

15
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,120
But there is no material

16
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,720
A lot of materials are needed

17
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:43,720
The so-called peaceful countryside

18
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,520
It’s the result of boiling all the ingredients together

19
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:48,120
It used to be peaceful here before

20
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:49,920
Can do business with merchants further west

21
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:52,520
So our Hexiang materials can be easily purchased.

22
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:55,120
But now our sandbank has become like this

23
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:56,120
Want to buy materials

24
00:00:56,120 --> 00:00:58,320
You can only find people in other cities to buy it.

25
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:00,920
But how can we buy it when we are surrounded by residents like this?

26
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:01,920
You write down the material

27
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,520
I'll find a way to buy it from outside.

28
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,120
You can help me do it then
